## 5. Accepted vs dispatched vs settled

| Rail | Distinguishes the three? |
|---|---|
| Fiat + crypto withdrawal | **Yes** — `withdrawal_progress_sheet.dart` polls `/withdraw/status/{ref}` and `/wallet/withdraw/status/{id}` |
| MoMo deposit | **Yes** — `/deposit/fiat/status/{rowId}` plus `deposit_recovery_service` reconciliation against `/finance/transactions?q=<ref>` |
| Susu cycle/payout | **Partly** — `/susu/{id}/cycles`, `/group-chats/{id}/susu/status` |
| Retail order | **Partly** — `/business/my-orders`, order tracking |
| **Friend transfer** | **No** — no status endpoint is called; a 200 is shown as final. Accepted is presented as settled. |

