| Writes | balance decrement, `PeerTransfer`, 2× `TransactionHistory`, `ledger.post(:transfer:)`, `directMessage`, claim CAS | balance decrement, `Withdrawal`, history, ledger, profit fees, fiat pool | conditional decrement + increment, history, `ledger.post(:wallet:pool-topup:)`, claim CAS |
